msgid "进程文件描述符"
msgstr "Process File Descriptors"

msgid ""
"ReliefNT 在原生 x86-64 Linux 系统调用 ABI 中支持 ``pidfd_open(2)`` 和 "
"``pidfd_send_signal(2)``。PID 文件描述符是 Linux 扩展，不是 POSIX 接口； 关闭、复制、继承以及 "
"``poll(2)`` / ``select(2)`` 使用普通文件描述符规则。"
msgstr ""
"ReliefNT provides ``pidfd_open(2)`` and ``pidfd_send_signal(2)`` through "
"its native x86-64 Linux syscall ABI. Process file descriptors are a Linux"
" extension, not a POSIX interface. Closing, duplicating, inheriting, and "
"using them with ``poll(2)`` or ``select(2)`` follow ordinary descriptor "
"rules."

msgid ""
"``pidfd_open(pid, 0)`` 打开进程组内的线程组首领。``PIDFD_THREAD`` 可指定 "
"单个线程，``PIDFD_NONBLOCK`` 可用于非阻塞等待。新描述符带有 ``FD_CLOEXEC``。同一进程的多次打开具有相同的 "
"inode 号；持有描述符不阻止 回收进程，也不会让旧对象在 PID 被复用时指向新进程。"
msgstr ""
"``pidfd_open(pid, 0)`` opens a descriptor for the thread-group leader. "
"Use ``PIDFD_THREAD`` to select an individual thread and "
"``PIDFD_NONBLOCK`` for nonblocking waits. New descriptors have "
"``FD_CLOEXEC`` set. Repeated opens of the same process report the same "
"inode number. Holding a descriptor neither prevents reaping nor redirects"
" the old descriptor to a new process when the PID is reused."

msgid ""
"进程描述符在整个线程组退出后报告可读；线程描述符只观察该线程。回收后 会同时报告 "
"``POLLHUP``，即使应用未订阅挂断。``epoll(7)`` 也支持退出 和挂断，不能用 ``read(2)`` "
"读取事件数据。``/proc/<pid>/fdinfo/<fd>`` 的 ``Pid`` 在目标被回收后显示为 ``-1``。"
msgstr ""
"A process descriptor becomes readable when the entire thread group exits;"
" a thread descriptor observes only its own thread. Reaping also reports "
"``POLLHUP``, even if the application did not request hangup events. "
"``epoll(7)`` also supports exit and hangup notifications. There is no "
"event payload to fetch with ``read(2)``. The ``Pid`` field of "
"``/proc/<pid>/fdinfo/<fd>`` becomes ``-1`` after the target is reaped."

msgid ""
"发信号时按当前调用者与目标的凭据重新检查权限；成功打开描述符不授予 发送权限。默认作用域由描述符决定，可用 "
"``PIDFD_SIGNAL_THREAD`` 或 ``PIDFD_SIGNAL_THREAD_GROUP`` 明确指定。``sig == 0``"
" 只检查权限和目标 是否存在；目标已回收时返回 ``ESRCH``。非空 ``siginfo_t`` 的信号号应与 "
"信号参数相同，且不得对其他进程伪造内核产生的信号信息。"
msgstr ""
"Sending a signal checks the current credentials of the caller and target "
"again; successfully opening the descriptor does not grant signaling "
"permission. The descriptor determines the default scope. Use "
"``PIDFD_SIGNAL_THREAD`` or ``PIDFD_SIGNAL_THREAD_GROUP`` to set it "
"explicitly. ``sig == 0`` only checks permission and whether the target "
"exists. A reaped target returns ``ESRCH``. A non-null ``siginfo_t`` must "
"match the requested signal number and must not impersonate kernel-"
"generated signal information for another process."

msgid ""
"``waitid(P_PIDFD, ...)`` 只等待调用者有权等待的子进程，支持 "
"``WEXITED``、``WSTOPPED``、``WCONTINUED`` 和 ``WNOWAIT``。默认也可等待同一 "
"线程组内其他线程创建的子进程；``__WNOTHREAD`` 将范围限制到调用线程名下的子进程。 未观察到事件时，``WNOHANG`` "
"返回零和空的信号信息；没有显式指定 ``WNOHANG`` 且描述符为非阻塞时返回 ``EAGAIN``。非子进程依然可以通过 poll "
"观察生命周期。"
msgstr ""
"``waitid(P_PIDFD, ...)`` waits only for children the caller is allowed to"
" wait for, and supports ``WEXITED``, ``WSTOPPED``, ``WCONTINUED``, and "
"``WNOWAIT``. By default it also accepts children created by other threads"
" in the same group; ``__WNOTHREAD`` limits the wait to children of the "
"calling thread. When no event is available, ``WNOHANG`` returns zero and "
"empty signal information. A nonblocking descriptor returns ``EAGAIN`` if "
"``WNOHANG`` was not requested. Polling can still observe the lifetime of "
"a process that is not a child."

msgid ""
"原生 x86-64 ``waitid`` 系统调用的第五个参数可指向 ``struct rusage``。 "
"有事件时返回内核为该子进程线程组记录的用户态和内核态 CPU 时间；其他资源计数 "
"目前置零，且不累计已由该子进程回收的后代的用量。没有事件时不写入该结构。"
msgstr ""
"The fifth argument of the native x86-64 ``waitid`` syscall can point to a"
" ``struct rusage``. For an observed event, it returns the user and kernel"
" CPU time recorded for the child’s thread group. Other resource counters "
"are currently zero, and usage from descendants reaped by that child is "
"not included. No event leaves the structure untouched."

msgid ""
"当前不支持 ``pidfd_getfd``、``CLONE_PIDFD``、``PIDFD_SIGNAL_PROCESS_GROUP`` 或 "
"PID 命名空间相关的 pidfs ioctl。不要将头文件中已有的系统调用号或 clone 标志视为这些功能已实现。"
msgstr ""
"``pidfd_getfd``, ``CLONE_PIDFD``, ``PIDFD_SIGNAL_PROCESS_GROUP``, and PID"
" namespace-related pidfs ioctls are not supported. The presence of "
"syscall numbers or clone flags in headers does not imply implementation."
